  headerText: Pick up fruit from the bowl
  contentText: Hover over a fruit in the bowl and press <b>LMB</b> to pick it up.
    This enters <b>fruit drop mode</b>. Move over the <b>wooden tray</b> next to
    the <b>bowl</b> and press <b>LMB</b> on the <b>fruit</b> again to drop the <b>fruit</b>.
